      <title>Just 7% of top 2025 films employed 10 or more women behind the camera</title>
      <link>https://www.kpbs.org/news/arts-culture/2026/01/02/just-7-of-top-2025-films-employed-10-or-more-women-behind-the-camera</link>
      <description>Just 7% of films had 10 or more women employed in pivotal, behind-the-scenes roles in this year's 250 top-grossing movies, while 75% of the same films featured 10 or more men in similar positions, according to a San Diego State University report released Friday.</description>
